cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data and code package, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
title: Machine intelligence on wireless edge networks — data and code
abstract: >-
  Data and code underlying the figures, tables and reported numbers of the
  manuscript "Machine intelligence on wireless edge networks". The package is
  split into a Data_availability tree (measured and simulated source data for
  every figure, table and note, plus the upstream acquisition and training
  campaigns) and a Code_availability tree (acquisition, analysis and
  figure-generation code) that mirror each other exactly.
type: software
